{"id":"p1-english-u06-m03","unit":6,"unitTitle":"The Caterpillar and its Palace","title":"Identifying Colours","class":"Primary 1","subject":"English Language","objectives":["Identify and name basic colors","Answer questions about colors"],"blocks":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Colors of the Rainbow"},{"type":"image","src":"/assets/p1-english/u06/colors.svg","alt":"A rainbow with 6 colors","caption":"A rainbow has many colors."},{"type":"text","md":"The rainbow has 7 colors:\n\n- **R**ed\n- **O**range\n- **Y**ellow\n- **G**reen\n- **B**lue\n- **I**ndigo\n- **V**iolet\n\nLet's look at colors around us:\n\n- The grass is **green**.\n- The sky is **blue**.\n- The rose flower is **red**.\n- The sunflower is **yellow**."}],"quiz":[{"q":"What color is the sky?","options":["Red","Green","Blue","Yellow"],"answer":2,"explain":"The sky is blue."},{"q":"What color is the grass?","options":["Yellow","Green","Blue","Black"],"answer":1,"explain":"The grass is green."},{"q":"What color is a sunflower?","options":["Red","Blue","Green","Yellow"],"answer":3,"explain":"Sunflowers are yellow."}],"passMark":70,"next":null}
